# No `-n` name is passed on purpose: `automatic-rename` is on with format
# #{pane_current_command}, and the catppuccin window format falls back to #W
# when @agent_summary is unset, so the tab labels itself "nu" for free without
# touching that (space- and quote-sensitive) format expression.
